  <entry>
    <id>tag:github.com,2008:Grit::Commit/fd826096ab12550b2959bdce9144ba5bd4e03c52</id>
    <link type="text/html" rel="alternate" href="https://github.com/sb-17/kanjii/commit/fd826096ab12550b2959bdce9144ba5bd4e03c52"/>
    <title>
        scroll fix, deck import fix, analytics fix
    </title>
    <updated>2026-08-31T13:31:23Z</updated>
    <media:thumbnail height="30" width="30" url="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/88972742?s=30&amp;v=4"/>
    <author>
      <name>sb-17</name>
      <uri>https://github.com/sb-17</uri>
    </author>
    <content type="html">
      &lt;pre style=&#39;white-space:pre-wrap;width:81ex&#39;&gt;scroll fix, deck import fix, analytics fix

- Scroll position restores on every route, not just the kanji list. Moved
  into ScrollManager keyed on location.key; KanjiList&amp;#39;s own copy removed.
- Deck import: select is no longer wrapped in a label, which on iOS made a
  tap open the next field&amp;#39;s dropdown.
- Trend summary spaced with flex gap, so hiding the separators on a narrow
  screen no longer runs the words together.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 &amp;lt;noreply@anthropic.com&amp;gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
    </content>
  </entry>
